{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e5d08382fd9055fba97e8b631c04dfe1785e7c8ecb8d29d1b3b4e1c419d38add","ja":"イェーイ、ウチらここまで絶好調だよね♪\n盛り盛りの写真がバッチリ撮れたってカンジ？","zh":"耶～，我们到现在为止都超顺的呢♪\n感觉拍出了超级上镜的大片对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a82075c6e479b9d93501fe5c56bb4e47bfa5184700cf7e3eacf39926a092c64a","ja":"うんうん、ジュリアもすっごくかわいく撮れてたね！\nピュアピュアなアイドルってカンジだったの。","zh":"嗯嗯，茱莉亚也拍得超级可爱呢！\n很有清纯派偶像的感觉哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6053b6c5850c16bcb16a7daed1435b2c4ed5701daf49472f054992db267df95b","ja":"あ、ああ……サンキュー、美希！\nそれじゃあ、後半戦もこの調子で……。","zh":"啊、啊……谢了，美希！\n那么，后半战也保持这个势头……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"de9af574c1864050ab2e2f251ee2220fd852f99af2c52de7375944057a825c93","ja":"えっと……アゲアゲのバリバリで、\n最後まで盛り上げちゃお☆","zh":"那个……就精神百倍、火力全开地\n一直嗨到最后吧☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a33665c8692ad376a46933fbd38418dd1b024e7477626a7b7f911deb5b914a4d","ja":"やっぱり、ジュリアさん変だよぉ。\nなにがあったんだろうか？","zh":"果然，茱莉亚先生很奇怪耶。\n发生什么事了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0cd5b8b31cd639d1f3b2ee3571848272b3f642e527eb5fff172828a69a60af84","ja":"私は、なにか悪いものを\n食べたんじゃないかなーって……","zh":"我是在想，是不是吃了\n什么不好的东西呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"90f249fbb6d239bd2d5ce71c12fbeee2699e795e985c350e0f16b9b30d5494b4","ja":"杏奈は、転んで\n頭をぶつけたんだと思うな。","zh":"杏奈觉得，应该是摔倒\n撞到头了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2762bc3dcb4ce9e0ef77e7cf9e7dac6d9acf574fd84188c95d559c1bc950c3fa","ja":"え～っ！　そ、それなら、\n早く病院に連れて行かないと……。","zh":"诶～！那、那样的话，\n得快点送去医院才行……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"cf12b10729a7828c7d4b724ad0268f281df0ddc6129925f942c7e73b985752c6","ja":"ヤッコ、アンナ、ヒナ……\nそんなことあるわけ無いだろ！　あたしは正常だ～！","zh":"八子、杏奈、日向……\n怎么可能会有那种事啊！我很正常啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"676ad1a848a7c459a36ef44a1fad39455f6c24f5e2650490cfa76d84dda89b82","ja":"あれ？　もう、いつものジュリアに戻っちゃったの？\nけっこう面白かったのにな。","zh":"咦？已经变回平时的茱莉亚了吗？\n明明还挺有趣的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"54441d42aeaa10eff27bba76e34889de8e4254dc2894c8c54b3b58af8b357abf","ja":"あたしだって、好きでギャルやってたわけじゃ\nないんだ！　これには深い理由があってだな……。","zh":"我可不是自己乐意才打扮成辣妹的\n好不好！这也是有很深的原因的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1333.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c48b89202ee80ba851bf70bdf85bdbb26f2f1886874e9827c6c1cc2bd94a064e","ja":"ジュリアがギャルになっちゃった理由？\nミキ、ちょっと興味あるかも♪　あはっ☆","zh":"茱莉亚变成辣妹的理由？\n美希可能有点兴趣呢♪ 哎嘿☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
